------------------+-------------+-----------+------------+------------+------------+--------------+-----------+-----------+------------
 tcs_replica      | 172.18.0.4  | streaming | async      | 0/1A000060 | 0/1A000060 | 0 bytes      |           |           | 
(1 row)

